    "name": "Chirality v3.0.1",
    "reference_limit": "The v3 references attached to each core-loop element come from App v3's JOURNEY_RESULTS.md, whose later journeys ran on development candidate 266c121bb (v3.0.0 era), which is not an ancestor of the v3.0.1 source. They describe v3 behaviour as context; v3 evidence qualifies nothing in v4 (R23-32 F-R2).",
    "release": "sgttomas/chirality-app release v3.0.1, published 2026-09-20T03:29:16Z",
    "remote_rechecked": false,
    "source": "projects/chirality-app-v4/reference/REFERENCES.md §2",
    "source_sha256": "07fe44e0494634ee40ae57a0b112f6fed7ae0b937fd3e2502574cd5431b240fc"
  },
  "basis": [
    {
      "quote": "v4 may replace v3.0.1 when both hold: the Chirality App supports the core loop at least at v3.0.1's level — plan, execute, save a workflow, reuse it, approvals, interruption, restart — and one live embedded journey in SWBPIPE runs from a request to the person's acceptance.",
      "ref": "docs/PRD.md §8 V4-REP-01",
      "source_sha256": "bb6e786f7a6c01dc5ce2f16f58e6c600989a12808ff47ce4fd87924bcc6c49bd"
    },
    {
      "quote": "The owner decides the replacement; the old projects and archives are kept until then (OD-09).",
      "ref": "docs/PRD.md §8",
      "source_sha256": "bb6e786f7a6c01dc5ce2f16f58e6c600989a12808ff47ce4fd87924bcc6c49bd"
    },
    {
      "quote": "Replacement is distinct from all-project retirement or professional reliance (B-HTML 07).",
      "ref": "docs/PRD.md §8",
      "source_sha256": "bb6e786f7a6c01dc5ce2f16f58e6c600989a12808ff47ce4fd87924bcc6c49bd"
    },
    {
      "quote": "The owner decides the replacement (V4-REP-01). The evidence presented for that decision is: V4-EXM-10 and V4-EXM-11 passed on the candidate App (the core loop at least at v3.0.1's level), and V4-EXM-20 passed on the candidate App and SWBPIPE with a local model (one live embedded journey from request to acceptance).",
      "ref": "docs/EXAMINATION.md §7",
      "source_sha256": "471798bc2f2dc0202ae40d9d5cf033a22ae41af2a0afdf58032cf37a687957d0"
    },
    {
      "quote": "The owner retains public-release decisions; the accountable professional retains professional approval/reliance. None follows from replacement, a merge or a successful operation.",
      "ref": "DEL-11-03 ScopeOfWork.md CLM-003",
      "source_sha256": "0177354357b07ea177491cffc2b1c75ffac578e179ba96e63e91d6ba34dcf5b6"
    },
    {
      "quote": "Carry limits of any practitioner observations without inventing a third fixed-duration replacement gate.",
      "ref": "DEL-11-03 ScopeOfWork.md REQ-005",
      "source_sha256": "0177354357b07ea177491cffc2b1c75ffac578e179ba96e63e91d6ba34dcf5b6"
    }
  ],
